      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      },
      "description": "One row per project. Availability counts business hours only (07:30-16:30 Mon-Fri Asia/Bangkok = 00:30-09:30 UTC). Coverage and audit values are the latest row per project in Postgres quality_metrics.",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "joinByField",
          "options": {
            "byField": "project",
            "mode": "outer"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Time 1": true,
              "Time 2": true,
              "Time 3": true,
              "Time 4": true,
              "Time 5": true,
              "Time 6": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "project": 0
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Not tracked in Grafana yet (TBD)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Tracked outside Grafana for now (TBD):**\n\n- **SDLC compliance** - audited via the SDLC checklist, not yet automated.\n- **Recovery time (MTTR)** - incident records, not yet wired to Grafana.\n- **Usage & satisfaction** - product analytics / surveys, not yet wired to Grafana.\n\nThresholds: availability >= 99.5% green / 99-99.5 yellow / < 99 red (business hours 07:30-16:30 Mon-Fri Asia/Bangkok); 5xx < 1% / 1-5 / > 5; P95 < 0.5s / 0.5-1 / > 1; new code coverage >= 70 / 50-70 / < 50; audit critical 0 else red; failed jobs 0 else red."
      }
    }
  ],
  "links": []
